{"name": "SaaS Landing", "html": "<section class=\"mrspb-hero\" data-gsap=\"fade\" style=\"padding: 100px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%); color: #fff; text-align: center;\">\n  <div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h1 data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #fff;\">Launch Faster with Page Builder Pro</h1>\n    <p data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px; opacity: 0.9; color: #fff;\">Build high-converting landing pages with drag-and-drop, premium blocks, forms and animations.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" data-gsap=\"zoom-in\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">Get Started</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding: 80px 20px; background: #f8fafc;\">\n  <div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 50px; color: #0f172a;\">Powerful Features</h2>\n    <div class=\"mrspb-row\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 30px;\">\n      <div class=\"mrspb-feature-box\" style=\"padding: 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05); text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\ud83c\udfa8</div><h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Visual Editor</h3><p style=\"color: #475569;\">Drag, drop and style every element in real-time.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"mrspb-feature-box\" style=\"padding: 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05); text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\u2728</div><h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Animations</h3><p style=\"color: #475569;\">AOS, GSAP and Lottie animations built-in.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"mrspb-feature-box\" style=\"padding: 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05); text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\ud83d\udcf1</div><h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Responsive</h3><p style=\"color: #475569;\">Desktop, tablet and mobile previews in one click.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mrspb-cta\" data-gsap=\"fade\" style=\"padding: 80px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed); color: #fff; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Ready to start?</h2>\n    <p data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 30px;\">Join thousands of happy customers.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" data-gsap=\"zoom-in\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background: #fff; color: #2563eb; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">Get Started</a>\n  </div>\n</section>", "css": ""}